From 5b581ec8ad78d1e8acea9fd308519c60a31184ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien Brault <adrien.brault@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:03:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 22/22] Add opt-in two-shot INT8 TP4 IPC all-reduce on SM80

Quantize finite BF16 partials in blocks of 256 with FP32 scales. Reduce rank-owned quarters in FP32, requantize and gather the quarters. Reuse the CUDA IPC allocation API with dedicated buffers and device epochs so graph replays cannot overwrite unread payloads. Include an independent codec and absolute error-budget CPU test.

Origin: dsv41 overlap round r17
Upstream: local numerics-changing experiment
